%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 02ff5e751dcfd764781b6d35bf16d1e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Set_4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  setName: The Wizard King
  narrativeSet:
  - paragraph: The King has fled from the land, fearing for his life and being too
      cowardly to take up the mantle and fight the demons. But who better to lead,
      than the man made of magic.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ec8093a56019304db6ff3c5f4aa5a45, type: 2}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: The Wizard pours through tomes and tomes of magic and mystery. The
      people will need to learn to survive.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 1
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ec8093a56019304db6ff3c5f4aa5a45, type: 2}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: The Wizard casts a spell upon the towers. May they stand tall and
      strong. They must repel the great evil.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: Soldiers gather in court and bow down to the Wizard king for his wisdom
      knows no bounds. They will follow him into a world of Chaos.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: "Goblins swarm the courtyard \u2014 until lightning cracks from the
      wizard\u2019s staff. Smoke, silence, and the faint smell of victory."
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: "Skeletons rise again, their bones glowing blue. The wizard sighs.
      \u201CAlways at night,\u201D they whisper, summoning flame to cleanse the graveyard."
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: "The coward king\u2019s crown still rests on the throne. The wizard
      refuses to wear it \u2014 power, after all, needs no ornament."
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: "Skeletons breach the walls, their blades clattering. The wizard conjures
      a storm inside the courtyard \u2014 rain and ruin fall together."
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 1
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: -150
  - paragraph: "Dawn breaks. The kingdom still stands. The wizard exhales, eyes glowing
      faintly. \u201CLet the cowards stay gone.\u201D"
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 1
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 150
  - paragraph: The old mine yields a new vein of gold. The wizard blesses it, though
      the earth grumbles in protest.
    addEcon: 1
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 250
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: The wizard blesses the crops, calling for a rich and fruitful soil.
      "Let no man go hungry in war."
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 1
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ab883eb9ce71c843ba63c82619b7649, type: 2}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: Trolls batter the outer wall. The wizard chants, and the stones themselves
      grow fangs.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 1
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 200
  - paragraph: "Goblins raid the armory. The wizard traps them in illusions \u2014
      endless hallways where their greed devours itself."
    addEcon: 1
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 150
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 200
  - paragraph: "The treasury lies bare. With a muttered spell, the wizard turns pebbles
      to gold \u2014 temporarily. Enough to buy another day."
    addEcon: 1
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 250
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 0
  - paragraph: The castle walls are repaired with enchanted stone. They whisper softly
      at night, remembering every siege.
    addEcon: 0
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 1
    econ: 0
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 200
  - paragraph: The Wizard takes a trip to the mine during a lull in battle. "Hurry,
      Hurry", he says to the miners, each blessed with haste.
    addEcon: 1
    addInfrastructure: 0
    addTowerHealth: 0
    econ: 250
    infrastructure: {fileID: 0}
    towerHealth: 200
